~ rival_intro

$> Cutscene.lock_player()
$> Cutscene.move("rival", "rival_stop")
Rival: You're the new tamer? Let's see what your team can do.
- Bring it on.
	$> Story.start_battle("rival_01")
	if Story.last_battle_won()
		Rival: ...Not bad. Don't get comfortable.
	else
		Rival: Come back when you've actually trained them.
- Maybe later. [if not Story.flag("rival_met") /]
	Rival: Figures.
$> Story.set_flag("rival_met")
$> Cutscene.unlock_player()
=> END
